  "scope": "Optics revision 5: closer visual correspondence to original artwork/composition; representative USA intro only.",
  "previous_evidence": "docs/mgs-effects-optics-v4-evidence.json",
  "changes": {
    "bubbles": "Original PCX artwork and palette continuously filtered in RGB8; original additive/quarter-additive energy and envelopes. No opaque analytic spheres when the original PCX is bound. Analytic fallback for packets without an original material.",
    "submarine": "Removed procedural Voronoi caustics. Original SubEfct projection u=128+RotZ(localPosition).x/8 reconstructed per fragment from original actor rotation and floating-point model transform. Original filtered material retains STP translucency.",
    "crt": "Original ScnMask additive shadow pedestal, RGB(80,0,0) or (56,120,40). Scene RGB retained, rather than monochrome remapping. Optical white point lowered to 0.32 red / 0.22 green; bloom starts on moderate source light. Guest-time scanlines/noise preserved.",
    "unchanged": "Water refraction/depth fog, snow and gameplay goggles retain revision-4 behavior."
  },
